==Notes==
* Nahkriin can only be obtained when in [[Skyrim:Skuldafn Temple|Skuldafn]] as part of the main quest. If you fail to retrieve it, you will not get a second chance to obtain it.
* Placing Nahkriin on its pedestal at [[Skyrim:Bromjunaar Sanctuary|Bromjunaar Sanctuary]] will remove any bonuses it gained from tempering.
* All dragon priest masks are considered to be circlets in terms of equipment slots, meaning they can be worn simultaneously with some bugged items, as detailed under [[Skyrim:Circlet|circlets]].
* Nahkriin means "Vengeance" in the [[Lore:Dragon Language|dragon tongue]].
* [[Skyrim:Hendraheim (place)|Hendraheim]]{{CC|Hendraheim}}, [[Skyrim:Shadowfoot Sanctum (place)|Shadowfoot Sanctum]]{{CC|Shadowfoot Sanctum}}, [[Skyrim:Tundra Homestead (place)|Tundra Homestead]]'s cellar{{CC|Tundra Homestead}}, [[Skyrim:Bloodchill Manor|Bloodchill Cavern]]{{CC|Bloodchill Manor}},  and [[Skyrim:Myrwatch (place)|Myrwatch]]'s gallery{{CC|Myrwatch}} contain a special holder for this item.

